  ('24960d57-ab91-545d-a8fc-6f59a4124cf1', '8bfb4f34-aba8-50f2-9a3a-5fa0ee748aef', 9, 'ING', 'ENG.9.6.P1', 'Students can select and use target phonological aspects such as pronunciation and intonation of target sounds, words, phrases, clauses, and sentences in utterances authentically, naturally, and accurately in the current content about ''''life in the city and country with local and international food culture and food festivals in the city'''' to develop holistic and conscious pronunciation skills after recognising them in context.', 'a) Students recognise the target phonological aspects such as pronunciation and intonation of target sounds, words, phrases and sentences in utterances within the current content by listening (to)/ watching it, first as a whole and then with pauses.
