  ('90c45bac-73b1-5097-9d7c-5a4a45e06939', '8bfb4f34-aba8-50f2-9a3a-5fa0ee748aef', 9, 'ING', 'ENG.9.6.R1', 'Students can prepare for reading the content on ''''life in the city and country with local and international food culture and food festivals in the city'''' efficiently and effectively.', 'a) Students recall and activate significant pre-existing knowledge and past experiences that can be related to the current theme and content through careful exploration.
