  ('ea8b642c-1b3d-5218-94da-d6d09b802dcb', 'dca53e78-8906-5089-a18d-a22bf6b664b4', 11, 'ING', 'ENG.11.3.L3', 'Students can make sense of and derive meaning from the current content on ''''personal life and well-being with providing well-being with physical health (body and illnesses); providing well-being with mental and emotional health''''.', 'a) Students check their initial predictions about the current content by being aware of the commonalities between their self-predictions and the clues provided as visuals surrounding the content.
