  ('b29a4660-d50b-530b-8b98-79039d9d5cc8', 'dca53e78-8906-5089-a18d-a22bf6b664b4', 11, 'ING', 'ENG.11.3.S5', 'Students can reconstruct the information about ''''personal life and well-being with providing well-being with physical health (body and illnesses); providing well-being with mental and emotional health'''' when communicating with others.', 'a) Students use the same or similar information presented in the current content in verbal or written forms in different contexts by reorganising it meaningfully, accurately, effectively, efficiently, functionally, and individually as required.
