  ('51a0c384-25e7-5cbf-bf51-ab0d398ef27f', 'dca53e78-8906-5089-a18d-a22bf6b664b4', 11, 'ING', 'ENG.11.4.S6', 'Students can reflect on their experiences, thoughts, ideas, and feelings related to the speaking process about the current content on ''''family life and home with family traditions, values, and customs (watching films together, preferences for films, music, and sports); family problems related to sharing a house and solutions'''' in relation to themselves or others, both individually and/or with others.', 'a) Students reveal their knowledge, experiences, thoughts, and feelings that they review critically in relation to the current speaking-expression content and process.
