  ('2dc4aad9-9d04-5ce4-ad19-ebafa363d93f', 'dca53e78-8906-5089-a18d-a22bf6b664b4', 11, 'ING', 'ENG.11.5.L1', 'Students can prepare and get ready for listening (to)/watching about the current content on ''''life in the neighbourhood, city and social life with types of cities, social life in the rural areas and cities''''.', 'a) Students activate their pre-existing knowledge and experience about the current theme and content to recall their background knowledge by investigating it carefully.
