b) Students share their personal knowledge, experiences, thoughts, and feelings that they critically review in relation to the current speaking-expression content and process with others.
c) Students produce new verbal and written work after participating in reflective activities related to the current speaking-expression content and process. 607', null, 'ENG.12.1', 'OGRENME_CIKTISI', 600, 607, null),
