  ('705e182a-6d0f-587c-a0bf-2e41280a80f2', '4241cd0f-f778-52b3-a364-6d17d325fe96', 12, 'ING', 'ENG.12.3.L1', 'Students can prepare and get ready for listening (to)/watching about the current content on ''''family life and home with the impact of technology on family life; the relationships between the family and community''''.', 'a) Students activate their pre-existing knowledge and experience about the current theme and content to recall their background knowledge by investigating it carefully.
